oads/fae/image/asset/2118/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Grammarly.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2118/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Grammarly.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2118/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Grammarly.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2118/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Grammarly.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2118/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Grammarly.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2118/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Grammarly.jpg","#FFFFFF",[51],{"name":52,"slug":53,"headline":54,"logo":55,"transparentLogo":64,"logoBackground":73,"colorFill":82},"Superhuman","superhuman","The fastest email experience ever made",{"id":56,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":57,"assetUrlXs":58,"assetUrlSm":59,"assetUrlMd":60,"assetUrlLg":61,"assetUrlXl":62,"assetUrlXxl":63},"565","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/565/SuperHuman.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/565/xs_SuperHuman.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/565/sm_SuperHuman.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/565/md_SuperHuman.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/565/lg_SuperHuman.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/565/xl_SuperHuman.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/565/xxl_SuperHuman.jpg",{"id":65,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":66,"assetUrlXs":67,"assetUrlSm":68,"assetUrlMd":69,"assetUrlLg":70,"assetUrlXl":71,"assetUrlXxl":72},"2233","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2233/IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Superhuman_1.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2233/xs_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Superhuman_1.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2233/sm_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Superhuman_1.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2233/md_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Superhuman_1.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2233/lg_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Superhuman_1.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2233/xl_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Superhuman_1.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2233/xxl_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_Superhuman_1.png",{"id":74,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":75,"assetUrlXs":76,"assetUrlSm":77,"assetUrlMd":78,"assetUrlLg":79,"assetUrlXl":80,"assetUrlXxl":81},"2234","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","#000000",{"contentTopicImage":84,"name":86,"slug":87},{"id":85,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"2429","Announcements","announcement",false,"2025-06-30","Superhuman Hits the Road with Grammarly | IVP",{"id":92,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":93,"assetUrlXs":94,"assetUrlSm":95,"assetUrlMd":96,"assetUrlLg":97,"assetUrlXl":98,"assetUrlXxl":99},"1842","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1842/GS-1840x1230-Header.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1842/xs_GS-1840x1230-Header.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1842/sm_GS-1840x1230-Header.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1842/md_GS-1840x1230-Header.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1842/lg_GS-1840x1230-Header.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1842/xl_GS-1840x1230-Header.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1842/xxl_GS-1840x1230-Header.jpg",[101],{"instance":102},{"__typename":103,"largeHeading":7,"heading":7,"body":104},"TextBlock","We love it when two of our favorite companies join forces.\r\n\r\nOver the last 16 years, [Grammarly](https://www.ivp.com/portfolio/grammarly/) has quietly become the most essential writing infrastructure on the planet, building what it describes as an \"AI superhighway\" with roads to all the places where words matter: browsers, productivity apps, mobile keyboards.\r\n\r\nWith the acquisition of [Superhuman](https://www.ivp.com/portfolio/superhuman/), Grammarly is putting a race car on those roads. And we’re fortunate enough to be along for the ride. \r\n\r\nWhen we first met Max, Alex and Brad in 2017, what impressed us most was their belief that communication is an essential part of what makes us human. Today, they help more than 40 million people and 50,000 organizations communicate more clearly and move work forward. We’ve helped them supercharge their growth through recruiting and fundraising.\r\n\r\nNow, Grammarly is expanding beyond its origins as an AI writing tool, creating a complete AI productivity platform for apps and agents. Superhuman will be a centerpiece of that strategy.\r\n\r\nSuperhuman first caught our attention because everyone we knew was using it. Founders, fellow VCs, friends and family all talked about how they’d been spending too much time on email — and that by helping them organize, prioritize, and respond to messages faster, Superhuman was saving them hours a week. \r\n\r\nWe also saw parallels between Superhuman’s journey and the one I (Ajay) had been on as CFO at [Dropbox](https://www.ivp.com/portfolio/dropbox/). So we became true thought partners, helping Superhuman hire executives and supporting its expansion beyond PLG with its team’s product.\r\n\r\nEarly on, we coached Rahul and the Superhuman team to keep their eyes open for the best way to accelerate their vision. And with Grammarly, that’s exactly what they’ll be able to do.\r\n\r\nSuperhuman has an incredible product that people who try can’t live without. Grammarly will now be able to get that product into the hands of more people faster. And with Superhuman, Grammarly will be able to help millions of customers revolutionize the way they think about and manage email.\r\n\r\nWe’re excited to see what happens when Superhuman gets on the Grammarly highway. Our advice? Buckle up.",{"id":106,"assetUrl":8},"484",{"assetUrl":8},[],"superhuman-hits-the-road-with-grammarly",[111,138],{"fullName":112,"teamSubcategories":113,"slug":124,"image":125,"abbreviatedTitle":134,"focusAreas":135,"emailAddress":136,"bio":137},"Ajay Vashee",[114,120],{"name":115,"slug":116,"teamCategory":117},"Apps","apps",{"name":118,"slug":119},"Investors","investors",{"name":121,"slug":122,"teamCategory":123},"Digital Health","digital-health",{"name":118,"slug":119},"ajay-vashee",{"id":126,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":127,"assetUrlXs":128,"assetUrlSm":129,"assetUrlMd":130,"assetUrlLg":131,"assetUrlXl":132,"assetUrlXxl":133},"2016","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2016/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Ajay_Vashee.jpg","General Partner","Artificial Intelligence, Future of Work, Finance Transformation","ajay@ivp.com","I came to IVP from Dropbox, where I guided the company through its IPO and first several years as a public company. As a first-time CFO, I stepped into a leadership role early in my career, and learned firsthand how to build, support and inspire a high-performing team. I also grew to embrace the uncertainty that’s inherent to leading a growth-stage company. I’m most proud of the impact my organization had—helping Dropbox scale to billions in ARR and hundreds of millions of users. \r\n\r\nAs an investor, I’m always on the lookout for companies that are solving big problems in market categories on the precipice of disruptive change. My experience as an operator is invaluable to my work at IVP, and I’m committed to being a hands-on, active partner to every company I invest in. I’m also focused on helping IVP build platform capabilities closely attuned to the needs of our founders. It’s why we launched the CFO Collective—the first community of its kind—which brings the brightest minds in strategic finance together to support one another and lay the groundwork for the future.",{"fullName":139,"teamSubcategories":140,"slug":143,"image":144,"abbreviatedTitle":153,"focusAreas":154,"emailAddress":155,"bio":156},"Jules Maltz",[141],{"name":115,"slug":116,"teamCategory":142},{"name":118,"slug":119},"jules-maltz",{"id":145,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":146,"assetUrlXs":147,"assetUrlSm":148,"assetUrlMd":149,"assetUrlLg":150,"assetUrlXl":151,"assetUrlXxl":152},"2363","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","Venture Partner","Productivity Software, Enterprise SaaS, Internet Technology","jules@ivp.com","I was surprised to find myself back in venture after graduate school. I love working closely with entrepreneurs, so I had fully expected to join a startup where I could play a critical role in helping a company grow from the start. But IVP presented the opportunity to do that at scale across multiple companies, and I realized that’s what I was searching for: the chance to help founders with incredible ideas make an impact in the world. I joined IVP in 2008 and never looked back.\r\n\r\nTechnology changes so rapidly that today’s enterprise and software products differ vastly from those that emerged just a few years ago. The companies that really take hold are those with a clear mission and an understanding of why their product needs to exist—the problem it will solve and the people it will help. \r\n\r\nIt never gets old to work with entrepreneurs from the ground up. Whenever I meet a founder for the first time, I enter the meeting with genuine excitement: this next company could be the one—the one to improve people’s lives, to build a new category, to fundamentally change the world. It’s an honor to listen to their ideas and work with them to fulfill their dreams.",{"id":158,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":159,"assetUrlXs":160,"assetUrlSm":161,"assetUrlMd":162,"assetUrlLg":163,"assetUrlXl":164,"assetUrlXxl":165},"1841","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1841/GS-800x800-Tile.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1841/xs_GS-800x800-Tile.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1841/sm_GS-800x800-Tile.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1841/md_GS-800x800-Tile.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1841/lg_GS-800x800-Tile.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1841/xl_GS-800x800-Tile.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1841/xxl_GS-800x800-Tile.jpg","Superhuman Hits the Road with Grammarly",1790351925598]